Paywall gate copy may stay above; purchase surface = Pricing twin.

## Behavior checklist
1. Qty ± updates Flex CTA total immediately.
2. ~~Terms checkbox~~ **REMOVED** — footnotes only; first-login assent covers legal.
3. Spend order visible.
4. Checkout still uses existing startPassCheckout / Payments paths.
5. Locale EN/ZH/ES/FR — align display prices to Pricing SoT.

## Out of scope
- Redesigning landing Pricing from scratch
- Changing spend-order server logic
- Deleting archived assets

## Engineer checklist
1. Inventory confirm; add missed Buy triggers
2. Extract or restyle one Pricing panel shared by landing + modal
3. Point entries 2–10 at that panel (center portal)
4. Kill divergent AccountBuySheet chrome (or thin wrapper)
5. Local only → Ready → Max tip to push

## Max tip overlay (2026-10-19) — LOCK
### A. No purchase checkbox
First-login already has forced Disclaimer/ToS. Buy/Subscribe UI must NOT require another checkbox. Remove `#v2-checkout-assent` / `CheckoutLegalAssent` gating from landing Pricing AND PassPurchaseModal / AccountBuySheet / unified panel. Footnotes OK; CTAs run checkout without assent check.

### B. Reconnect Buy/Subscribe → PASS grant full chain
Old buy/sub had mock “payment succeeded” then grant PASS / sub allocation. Unified UI must hit that grant path (not paint-only): Flex qty → ledger + grant; Personal sub (+2 first month) → allocation; spend order prior → sub → Flex. Mock gateway OK until MoR/Stripe.

